                <mxCell id="excl-spr-label" value="互斥 ✗&#10;(profile 时不允许写)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#cc0000;fillColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="640" y="610" width="200" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="excl-sproc" style="endArrow=classic;startArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#cc0000;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" parent="1" source="lock-server" target="lock-profile" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <Array as="points">
                            <mxPoint x="100" y="290"/>
                            <mxPoint x="100" y="590"/>
                        </Array>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="excl-sproc-label" value="互斥 ✗&#10;(server 重启&#10;不能 profile)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#cc0000;fillColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="700" width="160" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="excl-bproc" style="endArrow=classic;startArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#cc0000;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" parent="1" source="lock-bench" target="lock-workspace" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <Array as="points">
                            <mxPoint x="1300" y="290"/>
                            <mxPoint x="1300" y="590"/>
                        </Array>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="excl-bproc-label" value="互斥 ✗&#10;(bench 时不允许&#10;写 workspace)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#cc0000;fillColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1220" y="700" width="160" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="ok-1" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" parent="1" source="lock-server" target="readonly" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="ok-2" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" parent="1" source="lock-bench" target="readonly" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="ok-3" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" parent="1" source="lock-profile" target="readonly" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="ok-4" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" parent="1" source="lock-workspace" target="readonly" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="ok-label" value="并存 ✓ (只读 sub-agent 可与任何 lane 持有者共存)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#82b366;fillColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="540" y="540" width="340" height="20" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="rules-box" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="800" width="1320" height="240" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="rules-title" value="原子 multi-lane lease 规则 (§3.5.5)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="60" y="810" width="500" height="20" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="rules-text" value="• 所有 action 只能调用 acquire_many(required_lanes), 禁止嵌套获取单 lane&#10;• lane 获取顺序固定: workspace_mutation → server_lifecycle → benchmark_lane → profile_lane (防死锁)&#10;• 原子获取: 要么拿到全部 lane, 要么一个都不持有 (失败必须释放已获取 lane 并写 event_log)&#10;• lease 必须有 TTL + heartbeat; 超时后不能静默抢锁, 必须先写 lease_expired event&#10;• acquire_many 失败策略: 非阻塞 + 指数退避 (100ms → 1s → 5s), 总等待上限 lease_ttl × 2; 超时则 task 转 failed 并回灌调度器&#10;• Resume 时必须扫描 $SESSION_DIR/locks/, 把仍未过期的 lease 纳入 lock summary, 防止恢复后立即污染 benchmark/profile&#10;&#10;LockBackend 接口契约 (§3.5.4):&#10;  - acquire_many(lanes, holder_id, ttl_sec) → Lease    (atomic acquire-all-or-none)&#10;  - heartbeat(lease) → None                            (extend expiry while alive)&#10;  - release(lease) → None                              (verify holder_id, idempotent)&#10;&#10;默认 backend: FileLeaseLockBackend ($SESSION_DIR/locks/&lt;lane&gt;.lock with O_CREAT|O_EXCL)&#10;可替换 backend: 仓库已有可靠锁实现 (须满足同一接口契约)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="60" y="835" width="1280" height="200" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
    <diagram id="page-seq" name="4-KEEP决策时序图">
